WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.060
HARVEST, MAINE, USA

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.730
Honorable shirogane-Os.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.440
The time has come.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.990
We are to depart for the Sahara Desert.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.910
There, we will join up
with shiroganes from around the world.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.410
-Not just us, but the shiroganes too?
-Does that mean...

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.920
That's right. We've discovered
the location of our ultimate target.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:28.000
The Midnight Circus, the headquarters
of the automata.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.340
Finally, it's time.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:37.680
Ms. Lucille encountered
a canine shirogane in China.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.350
It sniffed out a trail
that led to the Circus.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.690
This information has been sent out
to all the shiroganes.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.400
My dearest shirogane-Os,
I am your Commander-in-Chief.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.950
An alien! Ta-da!

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.670
You people have no sense of humor.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.010
Never mind.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:18.510
You could say all your hard work
will finally pay off today.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:21.520
Let's head over to the desert

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.520
and crush the automata
until they become one with the sand.

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:28.060
We are the shirogane-Os.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.570
"O" signifying center,
as in the word shirogane.

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.490
"O" signaling the origin and the outcome.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:38.740
"O" heralding the obliteration
of the automata!

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:53.010
Before dawn, when the stars paint the sky

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:58.010
I am searching for the thing I lost

00:01:58.180 --> 00:02:02.680
With a restless heart
Under the sun yet in the dark

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:07.310
I patch together little prayers
to light my path

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.020
I don't need anything,
as my hands are full

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:16.860
My hands are full of emptiness

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:21.620
Please, just once, nod for me

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:26.460
Just once, reach out to me like the mirror

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.420
I will live for that single moment,
that single second

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:35.800
All the rest can just burn away

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:40.720
What's right for me is for me alone

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:45.890
Whatever the path, I'll follow it to you

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:50.480
This feeling grows and grows,
deep inside my heart

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.030
For one single reason

00:02:54.190 --> 00:03:02.120
I continue to climb up on the stage

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.830
#11 Fanfare

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.130
We finally tracked them down.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.470
The Midnight Circus.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.720
But dang, what a dog.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:27.140
It ran all this way to bring us here.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:34.270
To think that we shirogane
couldn't trace them for all this time.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.400
What?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.150
Don't even think about sending me home.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.610
I'm staying.

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.700
-Father!
-No, the ground is crumbling.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.410
But Father... My father...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.880
He lived out his life as a martial artist.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.750
He wished it.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:58.460
We have no time to grieve.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.550
Look at that shirogane dog.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:05.720
I don't know why, but it must've
guarded this spring all along.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.680
Has it picked up Pantalone's scent?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:15.440
That might just enable us to locate
the Midnight Circus.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:20.110
Father chose death
because of ZONAPHA syndrome.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.450
I must avenge him.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.410
You know that already.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.620
I won't get in your way.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:28.660
It's the same anyway.

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.870
If the automata keep spreading
ZONAPHA syndrome,

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.670
the world will die out before too long.

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.420
If death awaits us either way,

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:44.260
why not let her face it head on
so she has no regrets?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.970
You may be right.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.350
We must win this fight.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.940
To end the shiroganes'
long battle for revenge

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.520
and secure the future of all mankind.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.530
EARLIER THAT DAY, DEAUVILLE, FRANCE

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.250
You were up?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:21.050
Yes, I was counting the number
of roofs I can see from here.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:32.270
Gotta give it to you.
French buildings sure are pretty.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.770
What a strange man.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:40.070
Before coming here, you were
in Las Vegas. Before that, Switzerland.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.030
One vacation spot after another.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.950
What do you do for a living?

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.530
I'm an assassin.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.700
I used to be, anyway.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.620
And I made tons of money.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.420
Really?

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.420
You're so funny.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.210
Hey, how about we go back to...

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.090
Give it up.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.510
I'm tired of women, too.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.430
Suit yourself.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.770
You got in a fight at the casino, right?

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.890
Scary men were looking for you.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.650
That's nice.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.020
Bye then.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.650
You cheap swindler!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.070
Thought you could get away?

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:32.450
Finally, I feel somewhat alive.

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:44.960
What the heck is that?

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.680
I'm a shirogane-O, George Laroche.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.520
And you are Ashihana,
the Kuroga puppeteer.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.890
You are coming with me.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:03.070
You've got to be kidding me.
Out of the blue?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.480
I know all about you.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:06.900
You're bored.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:13.410
Come, and I'll show you a brand new world.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.040
I see. So?

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.380
How much will you pay me?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:31.550
Wow, there was nobody here
just a few minutes ago.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.390
I didn't know there were
so many shiroganes.

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.520
Ms. Lucille!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:39.060
-Fatima.
-Teacher.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.640
This is my jurisdiction.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.980
The troops are almost ready.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.030
Narumi, Mingxia.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.320
You know us?

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.450
Of course. You especially.
You're quite famous.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.160
Really?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.200
Stop drooling.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.500
Move over please.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.830
'Scuse me.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.880
The shirogane-Os from the US.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.800
Here we are!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.840
You never change.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:13.340
His face stretches?

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.550
What the heck are shirogane-Os?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:21.520
Former shiroganes who were
turned into machines by Faceless.

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.560
A creepy lot.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.980
You have a sharp tongue as always.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.900
But she's right.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:34.910
We now have bodies that can
destroy automata without using puppets.

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:39.660
Today our hard work will
finally be rewarded.

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:43.500
In that tent are Les Quatre Pionniers.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:49.260
Pantalone, Dottore, Colombine, Arlequino.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:55.180
And the reason all automata exist,
Francine.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.140
Defeat her, and everything
will come to an end.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.940
It's game time, automata.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.980
-A game?
-That's right.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:13.490
Automata are jesters
created to make the Francine doll laugh.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.990
Jesters love games.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.990
The rules are simple.

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.040
Let's see who's stronger,
automata or shirogane.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:26.500
We'll fight one-on-one.
The side with the most survivors wins.

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.670
I'm coming in.

00:09:31.010 --> 00:09:33.300
Let's go over the rules.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.900
I agree to your game, shiroganes.

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.520
Game on.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:54.900
Choose who will be on your team,
and come inside.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.700
I am Dottore.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:01.790
One of Les Quatre Pionniers
who you detest so much.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.210
We shall meet again.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.260
How could he?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.300
Lucille, who's it going to be?

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:19.260
Is that all you have to say?

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.510
One of your people just died.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:25.310
Naya was your aide for many years,
wasn't she?

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:31.570
Oh Naya, martyr of an honorable goal.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:34.320
My heart is broken forever!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.530
How's that?

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.490
You heartless jerks.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:42.870
Ignore them. Let's pick out our members.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:46.750
First, me. Next, Fatima.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.790
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:51.290
And Rockenfield and Timbavati.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.050
And Tor.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:54.800
Finally, Narumi.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:55.710
All right!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.720
Lucille, let me go too.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.640
Ugh, enough is enough.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:10.980
I, Zed, a shirogane-O,
will bring an end to this.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.980
Welcome. I'll go first.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.240
Not bad. Me next.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.410
Sorry, no time to play with you.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.330
All right. I don't like him,
but he's good.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.380
We might make it to Francine at this rate.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:38.760
Oh dear. We've lost two of ours already.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.220
Who should we call now?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.560
Who will avenge our brothers?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.310
Olsen!

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:53.310
Olsen, Olsen!

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.450
Here he is, our great hero.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:10.080
Merry-Go-Round Olsen!

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:12.330
Uh, hi.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.330
A merry-go-round?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.840
Impossible.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:17.460
You show-off.

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:20.470
You can't move with that on your head.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.350
You're asking for it.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:39.110
Stop, you've already lost!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:46.700
Wonderful, Olsen. A great victory.

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.950
My turn now.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.970
Stop, you'll kill yourself!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.880
-Shut up!
-Huh?

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:08.510
I'm in an ecstasy of fulfillment.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.530
That was so boring.

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:22.740
These people are crazy.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.660
Getting killed like it's nothing...

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.030
We'll go next.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.490
Let me.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:31.790
Excuse me, Narumi.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:37.040
We've never met before.
I'd like to see what you can do.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.920
Sure thing.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.920
Minghai, you must win. For Father.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:44.970
I know.

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:47.930
Yay, a shirogane.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:50.140
It's round 2.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.020
Can I ask you something?

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.400
What kind of person is Narumi?

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.440
Why do you ask?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.820
He's the talk of the shiroganes.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.660
They say he's so strong
he fights the automata barehanded.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:08.950
Strong, huh?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:13.290
Well, he trained under my father.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:15.580
He's a training addict.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:21.590
Say, for example, my father said
to understand the wind with your body.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:25.590
He'd stand outside naked until he got it.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:30.300
I like you. Come closer.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:34.980
My merry-go-round is starving.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.270
This whole thing makes me sick.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.770
But can you get close?

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.490
-Not again.
-He can't reach him.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.490
That's not all.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:52.870
Father told him to sense the movement
of armed men

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.490
while wearing a blindfold.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.330
And he really did it.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.960
Oh my.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.890
Wow.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.060
Is that all you've got, you little toy?

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.690
How magnificent!

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:27.780
Yeah, right.
He lets it go to his head all the time.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.030
You... I hate you!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.490
Come down here!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.450
Okay.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.370
No, don't listen to him!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.500
No!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.580
Narumi!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.540
Minghai!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.380
Not so fast.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:52.390
You can play with us if you want.

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:58.350
You puppets are so easy to fool.

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.100
There are a few tricks to fighting.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.560
One is to never listen to the opponent.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.570
Here I come.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.910
I want that girl in the cape.

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:17.950
I want the black-haired one,
Big Brother Orazio.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.370
Woah, the third round
seems to have started too.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:26.420
Orazio and Pedrolino, the acrobat brothers
are up next.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:30.260
What are you...?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.050
Swallow.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.470
I just swallowed your blood!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:42.350
This tent is full of ZONAPHA germs.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.230
Think of it as a vaccine shot.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:49.570
How dare you! I don't want to be immortal
with your shirogane blood.

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:53.030
You won't become immortal
from just that little drop.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:57.410
That's not the point.
I want to fight them as a human.

00:16:57.580 --> 00:17:00.620
-As my father's daughter!
-Mingxia.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:04.670
You can't buy anything from a shop
without paying for it, right?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:06.590
What do you mean?

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.050
To give up being human.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.340
That's what we shiroganes paid
to the shop of life.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.720
Now you want to join the quest
without paying anything?

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.640
And fight the automata like that?

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:25.770
Fine. Sorry, Lucille.

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:31.320
Among the coins I once paid,

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.610
I think there was one
that looked just like you.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.780
Nothing, forget I said anything.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.700
Enough chit-chat.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.210
Take this!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.210
Come, Spinettina!

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.380
How long will you last?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.390
We know all about girls.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:00.760
Got you!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.640
-He vanished?
-Above you!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:11.400
Things girls hate, number 1.
Disgusting things.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.320
You bastard!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:16.660
They make them lose focus.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.240
Mingxia!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:24.450
Missed me.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:33.000
My merry-go-round is hungry for more.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.550
We'll die if we're thrown in there.

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.180
Take that!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:46.180
We have to separate them.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.100
I have an idea.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:55.070
You think that'll work on us? How cute.

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.820
Where's the black-haired girl?

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.830
She was hiding!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.330
Hiding won't save you.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.540
She's not coming for me?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.800
So, then...

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.140
Smart move.
They can't help each other now.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.310
Don't think you've won yet.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.600
Things girls hate, number 2.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.900
Being stripped naked.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.610
Fatima!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.870
You little...!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.710
Gotta take a chance.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.420
This is the end.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.840
What?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.930
I can land on a narrow strip like this.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:04.930
And this strip leads to you.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.520
Human girls are so easy to conquer.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.940
Just tear off their clothes,
and look at them.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.490
Palm strike!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:26.530
Damn it...

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.170
Pedrolino!

00:20:35.380 --> 00:20:39.630
You have a lot more to learn about girls.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.930
Girls are great liars.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:49.640
We're going to lose?

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.350
No!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.690
I don't want to!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:01.990
London bridge is falling down...

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.910
Falling down...

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.370
Falling...

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.540
You fooled me for a second.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.550
You too. You even had tears in your eyes.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.300
Hey, you guys all right?

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:23.300
Narumi.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.260
Took you long enough. You're so lame.

00:21:26.600 --> 00:21:32.350
Shut up. You two stay put and rest up.
It's too soon for you to die.

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:33.520
Yes, sir.

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.980
Not bad at all.

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.480
Incredible.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:41.070
What a great show we had there.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.700
The shiroganes win.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.030
On to the next stage!

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:59.210
Ouch... Damn it.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:01.760
There are two doors before you.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:06.720
One of them will take you
to our symbol, our leader,

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:10.720
Our Lady Francine.

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:16.980
Fly up high, Marionette

00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:19.190
Turn to ash, gracefully

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:23.740
My only purpose in life was to fight

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:28.620
Why am I so angry
even I dump my humanity

00:22:28.780 --> 00:22:34.870
Without you, I can't smile anymore

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:40.090
I assume that I am to be blamed

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:44.550
Like a puppet that can't smile naturally

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:49.760
I feel like someone is pulling my strings

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:53.470
What am I even living for?

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:57.810
I was hurt, and thought
that nobody would understand

00:22:57.980 --> 00:23:02.900
But you came along,
and took me in your arms

00:23:03.070 --> 00:23:09.070
I felt my tangled arms and legs

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:11.490
become free

00:23:11.740 --> 00:23:14.120
Fly up high, Marionette

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:16.410
I think now I can reach you

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:20.920
Before I met you, I was empty

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:25.800
Now I have something
I'd give my all to protect

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:32.260
You taught me how to feel,
the feeling of sorrow too
